1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 17=

4
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:41,140
Chunhua!

5
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:42,860
Chunhua!

6
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:44,500
(Wenmo Pavilion)
Chunhua!

7
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:46,780
Chunhua!

8
00:01:47,740 --> 00:01:48,380
Chunhua!

9
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:50,900
Chunhua!

10
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:51,260
Stop right there!

11
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:51,940
(Wenmo Pavilion)
Who are you?

12
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:53,620
Where did this lunatic come from?

13
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:54,220
Let me go!

14
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:54,580
Get lost!

15
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:55,500
Let me through!

16
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:56,460
How dare you
disrupt Prince of Jin's wedding!

17
00:01:57,060 --> 00:01:57,660
Do you have a death wish?

18
00:01:57,660 --> 00:01:58,220
Chunhua!

19
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:02,340
Please, just let me talk to you
one more time!

20
00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:03,100
Chunhua!

21
00:02:03,860 --> 00:02:05,580
Please, let me see you one last time!

22
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,180
Chunhua!

23
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:09,740
(Wenmo Pavilion)

24
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:17,860
Liu Wenji...

25
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:22,420
Goodbye.

26
00:02:24,940 --> 00:02:25,780
Chunhua!

27
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:28,900
Chunhua!

28
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:34,660
♪To forge a blade within the heart,
one must temper it with hate♪

29
00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:35,180
Chunhua!

30
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:36,420
Chunhua!

31
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:37,780
Chunhua!

32
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,420
Chunhua!

33
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:46,460
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

34
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:50,100
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

35
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:50,940
That's what you get for barging in!

36
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:51,860
Go die!

37
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:52,860
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

38
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:54,980
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

39
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:55,500
Die, you prick!

40
00:02:55,660 --> 00:02:59,140
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

41
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:03,240
♪Ask not why longing has no end,
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

42
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:06,900
♪Ask not why longing has no end,
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

43
00:03:07,220 --> 00:03:09,300
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless
we lie apart♪

44
00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:11,420
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

45
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:15,900
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

46
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:20,140
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

47
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:23,860
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

48
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:27,940
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

49
00:03:28,460 --> 00:03:33,500
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

50
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:37,940
It's all your own fault.

51
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:41,740
She was so good to you.

52
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:45,540
You had so many chances.

53
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:48,660
Why?

54
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:52,620
Why put himself through this?

55
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:53,020
Just look at him.

56
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:55,540
(Wenmo Pavilion)

57
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:56,500
- Who is that?
- What's he doing?

58
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:57,060
Wenji.

59
00:04:01,860 --> 00:04:02,380
Wenji.

60
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:05,060
Get up.

61
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:18,420
It's all shattered.

62
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:27,900
Come on.

63
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:29,940
Let's go home.

64
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,020
Go home.

65
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:47,660
Let's go home.

66
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:53,300
Don't stay here. Go home.

67
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,420
You're ruining their wedding day!

68
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:57,340
Look at that magnificent bridal sedan.

69
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:58,020
Exactly!

70
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:22,380
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

71
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:28,900
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

72
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:36,380
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

73
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:37,020
(Chunhua,)

74
00:05:38,620 --> 00:05:39,500
(I once promised)

75
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:41,980
(that you'd marry a man
of your own choosing)

76
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:43,940
(and have a magnificent wedding.)

77
00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:46,300
(What I could never have,)

78
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:48,460
(I wanted you to have.)

79
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:51,540
(But)

80
00:05:52,420 --> 00:05:53,340
(I failed you.)

81
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:59,300
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

82
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:03,700
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

83
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:06,340
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

84
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:10,020
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

85
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:13,860
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

86
00:06:13,900 --> 00:06:18,140
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

87
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:20,780
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

88
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:23,980
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

89
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:27,220
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

90
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:31,940
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

91
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:35,260
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

92
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:39,300
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

93
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:39,940
(Chunhua,)

94
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:41,940
(one day,)

95
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:44,900
(I'll bring those people to their knees)

96
00:06:46,020 --> 00:06:49,260
(so they can never hurt us again.)

97
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:54,180
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

98
00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:04,320
♪Mourn the blooms of youth,
mourn my bridal hair♪

99
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:08,700
♪Mourn the blooms of youth,
mourn my bridal hair♪

100
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:14,540
♪Not another tear shall fall♪

101
00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:27,340
What does the Yellow Emperor's
Inner Canon say?

102
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:30,100
"Eat to excess, and you harm
your stomach and intestines."

103
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:31,300
Eat slowly.

104
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:32,340
Don't overeat.

105
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:34,660
Father, I've barely taken my first bite.

106
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:35,580
Enough.

107
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:36,820
Don't be cheeky.

108
00:07:37,580 --> 00:07:39,900
I told you to visit Chancellor Liu
whenever you can.

109
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:40,900
Have you been doing that?

110
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:41,940
Of course.

111
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:44,500
I'd love to visit him even more often.

112
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:45,780
That's my boy.

113
00:07:48,180 --> 00:07:48,660
Zidu,

114
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:51,500
speaking of which,

115
00:07:52,940 --> 00:07:54,060
the Crown Prince

116
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:55,860
has been unusually quiet lately.

117
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:10,540
The Crown Prince hasn't left
his residence in months.

118
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:13,620
Only his study companion, Yang Si,
comes and goes every day.

119
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,940
Ever since joining the Court of Judicial
Review, he's never missed a day,

120
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:18,060
rain or shine. Very diligent indeed.

121
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:19,620
Yang Si...

122
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:23,220
Wanyao seems rather close to him.

123
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:28,900
I hear Princess Danyang and he
are childhood friends.

124
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,540
Since he arrived in the capital,

125
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,740
Princess Danyang has visited
the Eastern Palace several times.

126
00:08:35,940 --> 00:08:37,500
Since the Crown Prince

127
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:41,900
allows Wanyao to visit so freely,

128
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:45,500
he must want to arrange a match
between them.

129
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:48,660
Young people can never hide
their intentions.

130
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:54,100
Father,

131
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:57,100
speaking of Princess Danyang,

132
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:58,500
I happened to see

133
00:08:58,500 --> 00:08:59,860
Prince of Jin's wedding procession
today!

134
00:09:00,660 --> 00:09:02,020
I didn't see the bride, though.

135
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:03,860
I hear she's a stunning beauty.

136
00:09:04,300 --> 00:09:06,380
Prince of Jin was smitten
the moment he saw her.

137
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:08,740
Father, you should've seen it.

138
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,500
The streets were packed with spectators.

139
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:11,860
Wait.

140
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:14,980
Prince of Jin's wedding?

141
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:17,100
What does that have to do with Wanyao?

142
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:20,340
He married
one of Princess Danyang's maids.

143
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:23,140
Which maid?

144
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:25,580
The one who went to North Jing with her.

145
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:29,420
That maid is still alive?

146
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:32,420
Oh, Father,

147
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:34,500
I found out something else.

148
00:09:35,540 --> 00:09:35,980
Guess what?

149
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:39,500
No matter how beautiful a maid is,

150
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:41,140
how could she rise so high overnight?

151
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:43,580
According to someone at the Imperial
Medical Office,

152
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:45,900
it's because she's pregnant!

153
00:09:47,260 --> 00:09:48,020
Is that true?

154
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,940
That's what the people
at the Imperial Medical Office said.

155
00:09:51,380 --> 00:09:52,260
Which physician said that?

156
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:53,660
Imperial Physician Huang.

157
00:09:54,580 --> 00:09:54,980
Sir,

158
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:57,460
something doesn't quite add up.

159
00:09:58,340 --> 00:09:58,940
But...

160
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:02,140
Whether by chance or design,
I cannot say.

161
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:06,940
A marriage can be arranged.

162
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,260
But if she's truly with child,

163
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,940
that's heaven's will.

164
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:16,180
Heaven itself is on my side.

165
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:18,580
Then...

166
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:20,220
Congratulations, sir.

167
00:10:22,820 --> 00:10:23,180
Mr. Wei,

168
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:24,420
what are you congratulating him for?

169
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:27,340
You're a grown man.

170
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:30,180
Stop wasting your days chasing gossip.

171
00:10:30,780 --> 00:10:33,460
Tomorrow, pay a visit
to the Prince of Jin's residence for me.

172
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:34,420
Sure!

173
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:35,580
What for?

174
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:37,100
Zidu,

175
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:40,060
prepare a generous gift.

176
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:42,020
Have Xianyao deliver it
to the Prince of Jin's residence.

177
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:42,740
Certainly.

178
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:46,580
But what does any of this
have to do with us?

179
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:50,860
It's been years since the Mu imperial
family had a new baby.

180
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:52,300
That's worth celebrating.

181
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:53,540
Indeed.

182
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:57,460
If that maid

183
00:10:58,180 --> 00:11:01,540
really gives Prince of Jin a son
and heir,

184
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:04,460
that would be cause
for a grand celebration.

185
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:23,940
Shang.

186
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:29,500
Why has everything

187
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:32,820
suddenly changed?

188
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:40,380
I come from a respectable family.

189
00:11:42,940 --> 00:11:44,380
I'm a good scholar.

190
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:46,660
I'm not bad-looking.

191
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:51,660
I'm a decent person too, aren't I?

192
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:57,380
I came to Sheng'an full of ambition,

193
00:11:59,420 --> 00:12:01,580
dreaming of becoming a noble
or chancellor.

194
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,740
Chunhua and I were in love.

195
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:12,460
All we lacked was a marriage deed.

196
00:12:14,260 --> 00:12:15,780
Everything was going so well.

197
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:19,340
How did it all come to this?

198
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:27,060
Wenji,

199
00:12:29,060 --> 00:12:29,860
get some sleep first,

200
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:31,380
all right?

201
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:33,300
For the next few days,

202
00:12:34,060 --> 00:12:35,140
you can stay here with me.

203
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:43,380
Shang,

204
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:45,100
tell me...

205
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:48,900
Am I really that worthless?

206
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:51,100
Otherwise,

207
00:12:52,220 --> 00:12:53,540
why would she marry the Prince of Jin?

208
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,580
She's not someone who chases
wealth and status.

209
00:13:01,180 --> 00:13:02,500
Chunhua is a good person.

210
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:04,460
Wenji,

211
00:13:05,380 --> 00:13:06,020
so are you.

212
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:08,220
The fault lies with the Prince of Jin.

213
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:10,180
And with Yu Cheng'an.

214
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:11,460
Not with you.

215
00:13:12,380 --> 00:13:13,380
And certainly not with Chunhua.

216
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:18,700
Then why did things turn out this way?

217
00:13:22,580 --> 00:13:23,340
Why?

218
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:29,060
How did everything come to this?

219
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:34,140
Why?

220
00:13:41,260 --> 00:13:42,260
Why did this happen?

221
00:14:20,380 --> 00:14:21,220
Greetings, Your Highness.

222
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:27,900
Your name is Chunhua?

223
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:29,980
Yes.

224
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:36,460
Why do you look so familiar?

225
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:41,220
When I served Princess Danyang,

226
00:14:42,060 --> 00:14:43,420
I had the honor of meeting you
a few times.

227
00:14:49,900 --> 00:14:50,780
I hear

228
00:14:52,540 --> 00:14:53,740
you're expecting a child.

229
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:01,660
Yes.

230
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:12,260
Move aside.

231
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:19,420
I thought the servants were just
spreading rumors.

232
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:21,860
I can't believe it's actually true.

233
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:23,580
Wonderful! Just wonderful!

234
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:25,780
Wonderful!

235
00:15:28,380 --> 00:15:29,300
You've only just arrived.

236
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,060
You must not be used to the food
and accommodations.

237
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:34,700
I'll visit Princess Danyang today

238
00:15:35,020 --> 00:15:36,580
and have your usual food and belongings

239
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:39,580
brought here, along with a cook for you.

240
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:41,540
Oh, right!

241
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:43,980
As for your furnishings and bedding,

242
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:46,300
I'll personally select the finest
from the storeroom.

243
00:15:47,100 --> 00:15:47,860
After all,

244
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:49,580
your comfort matters most.

245
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:53,060
Oh, and give the order.

246
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:55,420
Have several new dresses made
for my dear Chunhua,

247
00:15:55,900 --> 00:15:56,900
along with some fine jewelry.

248
00:15:57,940 --> 00:15:58,620
- Yes.
- Yes.

249
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:00,700
Come on.

250
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:03,500
If you need anything from now on,

251
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:04,580
just let me know.

252
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:06,620
From this day forward,

253
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:09,380
you're the most precious person
in this household.

254
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:11,140
Sit down.

255
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:15,900
How wonderful.

256
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:19,100
What are you standing around for?
Go pour some water!

257
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:20,780
- Yes.
- Yes.

258
00:16:25,140 --> 00:16:25,900
Thank you, Your Highness.

259
00:16:26,540 --> 00:16:27,660
Don't call me "Your Highness".

260
00:16:28,140 --> 00:16:29,300
Call me Lingyi!

261
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:36,580
Are you tired?

262
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:40,180
Look how thin you are.

263
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:48,380
Thank you for your trouble.

264
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:49,500
Not at all.

265
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:50,980
The Chancellor has instructed us

266
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:52,140
that whether he's home or not,

267
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:53,940
you're always welcome
to enter his study.

268
00:16:54,540 --> 00:16:55,220
This way, please.

269
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:56,020
Thank you.

270
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:23,100
(Liu Ruozhu, Chancellor Liu's Daughter)

271
00:17:23,220 --> 00:17:24,700
Like sounds resonate,

272
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:26,700
and like energies attract.

273
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:30,580
Like sounds resonate,

274
00:17:31,540 --> 00:17:33,020
and like energies attract.

275
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:37,060
Who?

276
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:38,460
Who's there?

277
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:42,420
My apologies.

278
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:44,780
Miss, I didn't mean to disturb you.

279
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:46,460
I didn't want to startle you,

280
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:48,180
so I announced my presence.

281
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:50,580
May I have your name, sir?

282
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:52,660
What brings you here?

283
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:55,220
I'm Yan Shang.

284
00:17:55,660 --> 00:17:57,580
Chancellor Liu invited me here to read.

285
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:00,740
So you're Yan Shang.

286
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:03,940
My father has mentioned you.

287
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:09,620
Just now,

288
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:12,180
I heard you reciting
the Book of Changes?

289
00:18:13,380 --> 00:18:13,860
Yes.

290
00:18:14,420 --> 00:18:15,900
Those two lines suggest

291
00:18:16,300 --> 00:18:18,260
that things of a kind respond
to one another.

292
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:20,300
It sounds strangely familiar.

293
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:21,700
I feel as though

294
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,500
I've come across the same idea

295
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:25,140
in another ancient text.

296
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:26,740
I know the feeling.

297
00:18:27,460 --> 00:18:29,380
When you can't remember
where you read something,

298
00:18:29,700 --> 00:18:30,860
the question keeps nagging at you.

299
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:32,580
You just can't let it go

300
00:18:32,980 --> 00:18:34,100
until you find the answer.

301
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:36,980
Does that happen to you too?

302
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:37,740
Yes.

303
00:18:40,780 --> 00:18:41,380
Miss,

304
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:43,740
can you remember any other clues?

305
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:51,060
I recall it had a similar rhythm
and structure.

306
00:18:52,100 --> 00:18:54,100
Perhaps from a text of the Qin
or Han dynasty.

307
00:18:54,860 --> 00:18:57,620
Amber attracts straw,
and magnets draw needles.

308
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:00,980
Is it from Wang Chong's Lunheng?

309
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,100
Yes!

310
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:04,260
That's exactly it!

311
00:19:05,620 --> 00:19:06,580
How did you know?

312
00:19:07,100 --> 00:19:08,820
I happened to read it a few years ago.

313
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:10,260
Lv'e,

314
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:12,020
go to the second shelf
of the Xuan bookcase

315
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:13,580
and fetch me the Lunheng.

316
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:14,700
Yes.

317
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:16,500
That's the one.

318
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:33,540
Thank you.

319
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:36,860
You're welcome.

320
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:39,180
I need someone to read aloud to me.

321
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,140
I'm afraid that might disturb
your reading.

322
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:42,180
Lv'e,

323
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:43,260
let's go.

324
00:19:59,180 --> 00:20:00,860
I've been here three times
and still haven't seen her.

325
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:02,620
I wonder what she looks like.

326
00:20:02,980 --> 00:20:04,660
The suspense is killing me!

327
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:07,900
I heard a magpie chirping this morning.

328
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:08,500
Sir.

329
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:10,100
Perhaps you'll meet her today.

330
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:11,620
You always know what to say!

331
00:20:17,780 --> 00:20:18,820
Sir, look over there!

332
00:20:47,180 --> 00:20:47,620
Lv'e.

333
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:50,340
Lv'e.

334
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:53,300
Lv'e.

335
00:21:04,940 --> 00:21:05,420
Lv'e.

336
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:07,420
Stop playing tricks on me.

337
00:21:23,660 --> 00:21:25,340
Why so careless, Miss?

338
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:26,340
- Who's there?
- Miss.

339
00:21:27,380 --> 00:21:28,620
How did you end up on the ground?

340
00:21:28,820 --> 00:21:29,860
Why don't you beg me?

341
00:21:29,980 --> 00:21:30,700
Let me help you up.

342
00:21:34,220 --> 00:21:34,860
Who's there?

343
00:21:35,900 --> 00:21:36,620
Forgive me, sir.

344
00:21:39,660 --> 00:21:40,140
My savior?

345
00:21:41,540 --> 00:21:42,380
It really is you!

346
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:43,900
I'm Yan Shang.

347
00:21:44,540 --> 00:21:46,220
Thanks to you and your father's
wise judgment,

348
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:47,620
I was saved from certain death.

349
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:50,260
I never expected to run into you here.

350
00:21:51,180 --> 00:21:52,260
So you're Yan Shang?

351
00:21:52,620 --> 00:21:53,020
Yes.

352
00:21:54,620 --> 00:21:56,060
You're the one who ordered

353
00:21:56,380 --> 00:21:57,300
my release from the Investigation
Office, right?

354
00:21:57,860 --> 00:21:59,740
I've never forgotten your kindness!

355
00:22:01,940 --> 00:22:02,180
Right.

356
00:22:02,580 --> 00:22:03,380
- Yes, exactly.
- Lv'e.

357
00:22:04,500 --> 00:22:04,980
Please,

358
00:22:06,060 --> 00:22:07,220
do me the honor

359
00:22:07,740 --> 00:22:08,660
of letting me repay your kindness.

360
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:10,500
How about Cuiyun Tower?

361
00:22:10,740 --> 00:22:10,980
Let's go!

362
00:22:11,340 --> 00:22:11,780
Cuiyun Tower!

363
00:22:12,060 --> 00:22:12,300
Let's go!

364
00:22:12,860 --> 00:22:14,140
- I'm busy today.
- Come on!

365
00:22:14,940 --> 00:22:15,700
What a fortunate coincidence!

366
00:22:15,700 --> 00:22:16,380
How about another day?

367
00:22:16,380 --> 00:22:17,020
Let's drink to our hearts' content!

368
00:22:17,220 --> 00:22:18,060
- Does it have to be today?
- After you!

369
00:22:18,060 --> 00:22:18,660
Come on, let's go!

370
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:19,460
All right, all right.

371
00:22:27,380 --> 00:22:28,100
Ruozhu.

372
00:22:29,540 --> 00:22:31,980
Yu Xianyao came by today.

373
00:22:32,740 --> 00:22:34,340
Did he run into you?

374
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:36,180
Yes, he did.

375
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:38,900
Fortunately, Yan Shang arrived
just in time

376
00:22:39,340 --> 00:22:40,380
and took him away.

377
00:22:41,620 --> 00:22:42,140
Father,

378
00:22:42,900 --> 00:22:44,380
that man is truly vile and repulsive.

379
00:22:44,860 --> 00:22:46,260
He hardly seems educated.

380
00:22:46,820 --> 00:22:48,220
I really don't understand

381
00:22:48,620 --> 00:22:50,180
what the Yu family is doing here.

382
00:22:50,860 --> 00:22:52,260
They only defile my garden.

383
00:22:53,020 --> 00:22:55,220
He's certainly no scholar.

384
00:22:55,820 --> 00:22:56,500
It's merely that

385
00:22:56,780 --> 00:22:58,580
his father, Yu Cheng'an,

386
00:22:58,900 --> 00:23:00,020
sends him here frequently

387
00:23:00,340 --> 00:23:01,540
to polish his reputation

388
00:23:01,620 --> 00:23:03,660
and show how broad-minded he is.

389
00:23:05,020 --> 00:23:05,420
Ruozhu,

390
00:23:05,940 --> 00:23:06,660
don't worry.

391
00:23:07,580 --> 00:23:08,620
First thing tomorrow,

392
00:23:08,980 --> 00:23:10,300
I'll tell the gatekeeper

393
00:23:10,980 --> 00:23:12,100
that when I'm away,

394
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:14,780
no one may enter,

395
00:23:15,580 --> 00:23:17,300
regardless of their status.

396
00:23:17,580 --> 00:23:18,180
Father,

397
00:23:19,020 --> 00:23:20,740
Yan Shang is a true lover of books.

398
00:23:21,460 --> 00:23:22,780
He's also brave and chivalrous.

399
00:23:23,660 --> 00:23:24,980
Surely he can still come in?

400
00:23:27,700 --> 00:23:28,300
Ruozhu,

401
00:23:29,620 --> 00:23:30,380
what do you think

402
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:32,780
of this student I've taken
under my wing?

403
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:33,860
Father,

404
00:23:34,220 --> 00:23:35,220
answer my question first.

405
00:23:36,020 --> 00:23:36,700
Just now,

406
00:23:37,180 --> 00:23:38,380
how was my zither playing?

407
00:23:43,340 --> 00:23:44,660
The Crane's Cry.

408
00:23:44,820 --> 00:23:46,260
Its cry reaches the heavens.

409
00:23:47,020 --> 00:23:47,620
Indeed,

410
00:23:48,340 --> 00:23:49,580
your music was clear and serene.

411
00:23:51,740 --> 00:23:52,820
I believe

412
00:23:53,700 --> 00:23:55,380
Yan Shang is no ordinary man.

413
00:23:55,980 --> 00:23:57,900
He's like a white crane
with snowy feathers and a clear cry.

414
00:23:58,740 --> 00:23:59,580
One day,

415
00:24:00,260 --> 00:24:01,460
his name will be known
throughout the realm.

416
00:24:21,940 --> 00:24:23,300
You've borrowed so many books.

417
00:24:23,900 --> 00:24:24,860
Do you have that much free time?

418
00:24:26,220 --> 00:24:27,380
Wenji hasn't recovered
from his injuries.

419
00:24:27,980 --> 00:24:29,700
I'll spend the next few days
reading at home,

420
00:24:30,420 --> 00:24:31,340
so I can keep him company.

421
00:24:44,500 --> 00:24:45,380
You're a third-ranked scholar,

422
00:24:46,340 --> 00:24:47,540
yet you still haven't been appointed
to office.

423
00:24:49,940 --> 00:24:51,660
Has Wei Shu received his appointment?

424
00:24:53,100 --> 00:24:54,580
For someone so hopeless with words,

425
00:24:55,260 --> 00:24:56,620
he somehow got assigned
to the Censorate.

426
00:24:57,860 --> 00:25:00,020
Perhaps it suits his temperament
after all.

427
00:25:05,500 --> 00:25:06,140
No matter.

428
00:25:07,100 --> 00:25:08,260
I may not be as accomplished as Wei Shu,

429
00:25:09,020 --> 00:25:09,980
but I have someone powerful
looking after me.

430
00:25:10,580 --> 00:25:12,380
Even if I never draw a salary
from the court,

431
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:14,380
I'll always have Your Highness
to support me.

432
00:25:17,460 --> 00:25:18,500
You placed among the top three

433
00:25:18,860 --> 00:25:20,060
and you're my favored companion.

434
00:25:20,820 --> 00:25:22,340
If you don't get a respectable position,

435
00:25:22,700 --> 00:25:23,740
won't that reflect badly on me?

436
00:25:27,540 --> 00:25:29,020
I'll go myself

437
00:25:29,340 --> 00:25:29,860
and inquire on your behalf.

438
00:25:30,900 --> 00:25:31,300
Your Highness.

439
00:25:33,420 --> 00:25:35,420
It would be easy to seek
the Crown Prince's help,

440
00:25:35,980 --> 00:25:36,900
but the path would be fraught
with difficulties.

441
00:25:38,140 --> 00:25:38,620
What a coincidence!

442
00:25:39,100 --> 00:25:40,620
We're thinking alike again.

443
00:25:41,780 --> 00:25:43,020
I'm going to see Yu Cheng'an.

444
00:25:54,060 --> 00:25:54,740
Thank you, Lord Yu.

445
00:25:55,980 --> 00:25:57,860
For Yan Shang again?

446
00:26:00,660 --> 00:26:02,940
Previously, to save him,

447
00:26:03,220 --> 00:26:04,700
you personally visited
the Investigation Office.

448
00:26:05,140 --> 00:26:07,860
Now you've come to see me in person

449
00:26:08,340 --> 00:26:09,340
to secure

450
00:26:09,980 --> 00:26:10,980
an official post for him.

451
00:26:11,460 --> 00:26:11,860
Your Highness,

452
00:26:12,380 --> 00:26:13,460
he's merely a male favorite.

453
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:15,820
You're giving him
far too much attention.

454
00:26:16,860 --> 00:26:17,820
Well, he did earn

455
00:26:18,460 --> 00:26:19,940
his third-place ranking on his own.

456
00:26:21,420 --> 00:26:22,220
Besides,

457
00:26:22,820 --> 00:26:24,580
he knows just how to please me,

458
00:26:25,260 --> 00:26:27,420
and he's exactly my type.

459
00:26:28,580 --> 00:26:30,820
Surely he's worth a little extra effort.

460
00:26:32,100 --> 00:26:33,260
If you truly care about me, Lord Yu,

461
00:26:33,740 --> 00:26:34,900
please do me this one favor.

462
00:26:36,900 --> 00:26:37,380
Your Highness,

463
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:39,260
that man

464
00:26:40,100 --> 00:26:42,060
managed to land himself in prison.

465
00:26:42,060 --> 00:26:43,740
He's clearly a troublemaker.

466
00:26:44,140 --> 00:26:44,820
Your Highness,

467
00:26:45,580 --> 00:26:47,340
no matter how fond you are of him,

468
00:26:47,540 --> 00:26:48,700
you must know your limits,

469
00:26:49,220 --> 00:26:50,580
lest you invite more gossip.

470
00:26:51,380 --> 00:26:52,540
I've already been the subject

471
00:26:52,940 --> 00:26:54,140
of more gossip than I can count.

472
00:26:55,020 --> 00:26:56,180
What's a little more?

473
00:26:57,260 --> 00:26:58,860
Thank you for your concern, Lord Yu.

474
00:26:59,420 --> 00:27:00,260
Of course. Of course.

475
00:27:01,060 --> 00:27:01,380
Have some tea.

476
00:27:09,620 --> 00:27:11,060
I hear you've visited

477
00:27:11,580 --> 00:27:12,860
the Eastern Palace several times lately.

478
00:27:13,220 --> 00:27:14,260
Is that true?

479
00:27:18,460 --> 00:27:19,900
Nothing gets past you, does it?

480
00:27:21,380 --> 00:27:22,500
Yang Si was away from the capital
for so long.

481
00:27:23,020 --> 00:27:24,980
Now he's back, he spends all day
at the Eastern Palace.

482
00:27:26,140 --> 00:27:27,100
Although

483
00:27:27,420 --> 00:27:29,060
my feelings for Yan Shang are genuine,

484
00:27:29,980 --> 00:27:31,220
Yang Si and I

485
00:27:31,740 --> 00:27:33,260
have been close since childhood.

486
00:27:34,980 --> 00:27:35,380
I see.

487
00:27:37,260 --> 00:27:39,220
Then between Yang Si

488
00:27:40,220 --> 00:27:41,380
and Yan Shang,

489
00:27:41,860 --> 00:27:42,500
which one

490
00:27:43,180 --> 00:27:43,860
holds your heart?

491
00:27:49,380 --> 00:27:50,380
I'm a lady.

492
00:27:51,220 --> 00:27:53,100
That's such an embarrassing question.

493
00:27:53,660 --> 00:27:55,980
Lord Yu, please don't put me
on the spot.

494
00:27:57,020 --> 00:27:57,780
All right, all right.

495
00:27:58,180 --> 00:27:58,700
Very well.

496
00:27:59,060 --> 00:27:59,460
Yes,

497
00:28:00,020 --> 00:28:00,980
I shouldn't have asked.

498
00:28:02,380 --> 00:28:04,180
Since you've come here personally,

499
00:28:04,260 --> 00:28:06,900
you must already have a position in mind

500
00:28:06,900 --> 00:28:08,860
for the third-place scholar.

501
00:28:09,180 --> 00:28:10,140
Let's hear it.

502
00:28:11,380 --> 00:28:12,220
How about a Secretary
at the Ministry of Personnel?

503
00:28:14,340 --> 00:28:15,260
Or, the Ministry of Revenue
would do too.

504
00:28:16,540 --> 00:28:18,340
Your Highness, do you know

505
00:28:18,780 --> 00:28:20,300
what these positions actually entail?

506
00:28:21,180 --> 00:28:22,580
I've already looked into them.

507
00:28:23,580 --> 00:28:26,020
They oversee important
administrative affairs

508
00:28:26,540 --> 00:28:28,500
and come with plenty of perks.

509
00:28:29,260 --> 00:28:30,660
So many people are vying for them.

510
00:28:31,100 --> 00:28:32,540
Without your approval,

511
00:28:33,140 --> 00:28:34,860
how could my male favorite ever get one?

512
00:28:36,060 --> 00:28:36,900
Even with my approval,

513
00:28:38,140 --> 00:28:38,980
they wouldn't suit him.

514
00:28:39,900 --> 00:28:40,780
Lord Yu!

515
00:28:43,020 --> 00:28:44,100
These positions

516
00:28:44,540 --> 00:28:45,820
are mired in corruption.

517
00:28:46,420 --> 00:28:48,180
He's a young man from out of town,

518
00:28:48,460 --> 00:28:49,620
and rather impulsive.

519
00:28:49,900 --> 00:28:51,300
They really wouldn't suit him.

520
00:28:57,940 --> 00:28:59,180
Then, in your opinion,

521
00:28:59,740 --> 00:29:00,860
what position would suit him?

522
00:29:02,300 --> 00:29:02,940
Why not make him

523
00:29:03,820 --> 00:29:06,260
a Collator at Hongwen Hall?

524
00:29:06,980 --> 00:29:08,020
It's a respectable scholarly post,

525
00:29:08,380 --> 00:29:10,660
worthy of his third-place ranking.

526
00:29:17,060 --> 00:29:18,020
I'll leave it in your hands, Lord Yu.

527
00:29:29,740 --> 00:29:30,100
Good morning!

528
00:29:30,100 --> 00:29:32,220
(Hongwen Hall;
Pursuit of Wisdom; Quiet Contemplation)

529
00:29:40,860 --> 00:29:42,900
I think yesterday's annotation
was incorrect.

530
00:29:44,140 --> 00:29:45,580
Then I'll revise it now.

531
00:29:47,620 --> 00:29:49,340
Who's collecting today's
proofreading work?

532
00:29:56,540 --> 00:29:56,940
I'm Yan Shang.

533
00:30:00,820 --> 00:30:01,260
Thank you.

534
00:30:21,580 --> 00:30:22,100
Cui Ren,

535
00:30:22,580 --> 00:30:24,540
your insight is truly remarkable.

536
00:30:24,620 --> 00:30:27,860
(Cui Ren, Collator at Hongwen Hall;
Wang She, Collator at Hongwen Hall)

537
00:30:44,900 --> 00:30:45,660
Excuse me, sir,

538
00:30:47,540 --> 00:30:48,260
may I use

539
00:30:49,020 --> 00:30:49,780
this desk?

540
00:30:49,780 --> 00:30:51,660
(Xu Jiangping, Collator at Hongwen Hall)

541
00:31:00,180 --> 00:31:01,380
How far standards have fallen!

542
00:31:02,460 --> 00:31:03,900
Someone who trades on his looks

543
00:31:04,140 --> 00:31:05,900
can now hold the same rank as us!

544
00:31:07,700 --> 00:31:08,540
Xu Jiangping.

545
00:31:09,940 --> 00:31:10,300
What?

546
00:31:10,860 --> 00:31:12,620
Are you afraid of his powerful backer?

547
00:31:13,220 --> 00:31:13,980
Well, I'm not.

548
00:31:14,580 --> 00:31:15,060
She's nothing

549
00:31:15,540 --> 00:31:16,620
but a widow.

550
00:31:17,540 --> 00:31:18,260
A widow?

551
00:31:19,580 --> 00:31:20,340
Do you mean

552
00:31:20,780 --> 00:31:21,780
Princess Danyang?

553
00:31:32,660 --> 00:31:33,900
Princess Danyang is a widow

554
00:31:34,340 --> 00:31:36,260
because the military governor
of the Central Circuit died young.

555
00:31:37,140 --> 00:31:38,340
She married him

556
00:31:38,660 --> 00:31:40,460
to secure peace for part of Huai.

557
00:31:41,140 --> 00:31:43,660
She sacrificed her own happiness
for the realm.

558
00:31:44,460 --> 00:31:45,380
Shouldn't we men

559
00:31:45,820 --> 00:31:46,620
feel ashamed

560
00:31:47,700 --> 00:31:49,140
rather than spread malicious rumors
about her?

561
00:31:49,940 --> 00:31:50,900
Your words were inappropriate,
weren't they?

562
00:31:57,060 --> 00:31:58,300
You've got quite a sharp tongue.

563
00:31:59,100 --> 00:32:00,060
So that's what

564
00:32:01,420 --> 00:32:02,060
the Princess likes.

565
00:32:04,980 --> 00:32:06,100
There's something you don't know.

566
00:32:06,980 --> 00:32:08,020
What the Princess admires

567
00:32:08,540 --> 00:32:09,740
is my skill with a bow.

568
00:32:10,300 --> 00:32:10,900
That much is true.

569
00:32:12,260 --> 00:32:13,780
When Yan Shang shot Zheng Xing

570
00:32:14,100 --> 00:32:15,020
and was imprisoned
at the Investigation Office,

571
00:32:15,780 --> 00:32:16,900
it was a courageous act.

572
00:32:23,260 --> 00:32:23,700
Of course,

573
00:32:24,380 --> 00:32:26,540
the Princess also appreciates
my good looks.

574
00:32:28,020 --> 00:32:28,620
But

575
00:32:29,540 --> 00:32:31,260
you're quite handsome yourself.

576
00:32:31,780 --> 00:32:33,420
Perhaps she'd find you
even more attractive.

577
00:32:33,940 --> 00:32:34,380
Why don't

578
00:32:34,860 --> 00:32:36,420
I introduce you to her?

579
00:32:40,300 --> 00:32:40,980
No, no need!

580
00:32:54,220 --> 00:32:55,700
Annotating the History
of the Northern Dynasties?

581
00:32:58,980 --> 00:33:01,580
I hear its editions vary widely
and contain many errors.

582
00:33:01,860 --> 00:33:02,780
Tracing them back to their sources

583
00:33:03,380 --> 00:33:04,940
gives me a headache
just thinking about it.

584
00:33:05,740 --> 00:33:06,540
Tell me about it.

585
00:33:07,020 --> 00:33:08,340
It's given me a few gray hairs.

586
00:33:11,060 --> 00:33:12,100
I'm new here

587
00:33:12,260 --> 00:33:12,980
and still learning the ropes.

588
00:33:13,460 --> 00:33:14,460
I'm especially inexperienced
at proofreading.

589
00:33:15,140 --> 00:33:15,620
I hope

590
00:33:16,220 --> 00:33:16,940
you'll offer me some guidance.

591
00:33:18,140 --> 00:33:18,700
You're too modest.

592
00:33:19,780 --> 00:33:20,340
We can learn from each other.

593
00:33:27,980 --> 00:33:29,760
(Wei's ancestors descended from Emperor
Xuanyuan. His son was named Changyi.)

594
00:33:29,760 --> 00:33:31,620
(Changyi's youngest son ruled
the north. Named after Mount Xianbei.)

595
00:33:34,380 --> 00:33:35,660
In the Princess's library,

596
00:33:36,300 --> 00:33:37,940
I believe there are several
older editions.

597
00:33:40,140 --> 00:33:40,820
Please tell me more.

598
00:33:43,140 --> 00:33:45,780
I've long heard that Princess Danyang
is an avid book collector.

599
00:33:47,340 --> 00:33:48,460
I wonder if you could

600
00:33:49,060 --> 00:33:50,420
borrow those editions for us to examine?

601
00:33:51,100 --> 00:33:51,420
Yes.

602
00:33:51,700 --> 00:33:52,780
Could you bring them here?

603
00:34:35,300 --> 00:34:36,020
Try this!

604
00:34:37,460 --> 00:34:39,060
Come, let me drink to you!

605
00:34:40,820 --> 00:34:41,180
Try some.

606
00:34:41,180 --> 00:34:41,740
Let me fill your cup.

607
00:34:41,820 --> 00:34:42,900
How interesting.

608
00:34:46,620 --> 00:34:46,980
Delicious.

609
00:34:47,460 --> 00:34:48,500
All right, all right.

610
00:34:50,620 --> 00:34:51,460
Fill it up! Fill it up!

611
00:34:52,860 --> 00:34:53,340
Cheers!

612
00:34:53,340 --> 00:34:54,020
I'll drink first.

613
00:35:11,500 --> 00:35:12,020
Wenji!

614
00:35:12,820 --> 00:35:13,620
I finished work early today.

615
00:35:13,780 --> 00:35:14,900
I picked up three days' worth
of medicine for you.

616
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:16,460
I also bought some mutton pastries.

617
00:35:16,780 --> 00:35:17,540
Try them while they're hot!

618
00:35:34,700 --> 00:35:36,140
Your archery skills really
are incredible, sir.

619
00:35:36,300 --> 00:35:37,820
You even shot a wild roe deer.

620
00:35:37,820 --> 00:35:39,660
Of course! Who do you think I am?

621
00:35:40,260 --> 00:35:41,820
Waiter! Bring me your finest food
and wine!

622
00:35:42,180 --> 00:35:42,500
Coming right up!

623
00:35:46,580 --> 00:35:46,940
Good, isn't it?

624
00:35:47,380 --> 00:35:48,380
How dare you get in my way?

625
00:35:48,820 --> 00:35:49,260
I'll show you...

626
00:35:49,260 --> 00:35:50,500
(Zhang Jun,
Son of the Minister of Revenue)

627
00:35:50,500 --> 00:35:51,260
Don't be afraid, dear.

628
00:35:51,900 --> 00:35:52,860
(Chunniang)
Well, hello, pretty lady!

629
00:35:53,100 --> 00:35:54,180
Aren't you a beauty!

630
00:35:54,260 --> 00:35:55,300
Come have a drink with me!

631
00:35:55,300 --> 00:35:55,660
Go away!

632
00:35:55,660 --> 00:35:56,780
I'll pay you handsomely.

633
00:35:56,780 --> 00:35:57,420
Show some respect!

634
00:35:57,420 --> 00:35:59,140
Respect? Why should I show you respect?

635
00:35:59,820 --> 00:36:00,260
Darling!

636
00:36:00,260 --> 00:36:01,140
Where do you think you're going?

637
00:36:01,540 --> 00:36:02,380
- Stay right there.
- Chunniang!

638
00:36:02,380 --> 00:36:02,700
Behave yourself!

639
00:36:02,700 --> 00:36:03,100
Chunniang!

640
00:36:03,220 --> 00:36:04,220
- Let go of me!
- Keep me company!

641
00:36:04,220 --> 00:36:04,780
- Let go!
- Darling!

642
00:36:04,780 --> 00:36:05,700
- Aren't I better-looking than him?
- Chunniang!

643
00:36:05,940 --> 00:36:07,140
- What are you doing?
- Chunhua.

644
00:36:07,140 --> 00:36:07,540
Let go of me!

645
00:36:07,660 --> 00:36:08,900
- Just have one drink with me!
- (Hold still!)

646
00:36:09,060 --> 00:36:09,820
- Chunniang!
- I'll make it worth your while.

647
00:36:09,820 --> 00:36:10,500
Chunhua!

648
00:36:10,500 --> 00:36:10,990
- I'll pay you.
- Let go!

649
00:36:10,990 --> 00:36:11,540
Chunniang!

650
00:36:12,420 --> 00:36:12,860
Chunniang!

651
00:36:12,860 --> 00:36:13,420
Darling!

652
00:36:13,420 --> 00:36:13,940
Chunniang!

653
00:36:13,940 --> 00:36:14,460
Don't move!

654
00:36:14,460 --> 00:36:15,060
Let me go!

655
00:36:15,370 --> 00:36:15,970
Chunhua!

656
00:36:17,180 --> 00:36:17,700
Let go!

657
00:36:19,180 --> 00:36:20,100
How dare you harass her!

658
00:36:20,460 --> 00:36:21,340
How dare you harass her!

659
00:36:21,340 --> 00:36:22,420
So what if I harass her?

660
00:36:23,340 --> 00:36:24,220
I'll do whatever I want to her!

661
00:36:24,460 --> 00:36:24,780
Let go!

662
00:36:24,780 --> 00:36:26,180
Even her own husband
doesn't dare object!

663
00:36:26,380 --> 00:36:27,300
Who the hell are you, you cuckold?

664
00:36:28,260 --> 00:36:29,500
You're her old lover, aren't you?

665
00:36:30,220 --> 00:36:31,060
You can't treat her like that!

666
00:36:31,380 --> 00:36:32,380
Leave her alone!

667
00:36:42,180 --> 00:36:42,740
Stop!

668
00:36:45,220 --> 00:36:45,740
Let go!

669
00:36:46,060 --> 00:36:47,140
Chunniang! Chunniang!

670
00:36:48,340 --> 00:36:48,900
Hold still!

671
00:36:51,020 --> 00:36:51,900
That's for harassing her!

672
00:36:52,100 --> 00:36:52,980
That's for harassing her!

673
00:36:53,180 --> 00:36:55,820
That's for harassing her!
Harassing her!

674
00:36:55,820 --> 00:36:56,860
What are you standing around for?

675
00:36:56,860 --> 00:36:57,580
Stop him!

676
00:36:57,740 --> 00:36:58,260
Stop him!

677
00:36:58,500 --> 00:36:58,980
Stop him!

678
00:36:59,100 --> 00:36:59,740
Stop him!

679
00:36:59,860 --> 00:37:00,540
Stop him!

680
00:37:00,540 --> 00:37:01,260
Let me go!

681
00:37:03,300 --> 00:37:03,860
Get off me!

682
00:37:09,100 --> 00:37:09,700
Let me go!

683
00:37:10,180 --> 00:37:10,740
Let her go!

684
00:37:14,100 --> 00:37:15,300
Hold his legs down!

685
00:37:49,940 --> 00:37:50,860
He's going to die!

686
00:37:50,860 --> 00:37:51,260
What do we do?

687
00:37:51,900 --> 00:37:52,700
What are we going to do?

688
00:37:52,860 --> 00:37:54,460
Get a doctor! Hurry!

689
00:37:54,780 --> 00:37:55,380
Get a doctor!

690
00:37:55,740 --> 00:37:56,300
I'll go! I'll go!

691
00:37:56,740 --> 00:37:57,100
Wake up!

692
00:37:57,820 --> 00:37:58,460
Poor thing!

693
00:37:58,940 --> 00:37:59,420
Wake up!

694
00:37:59,940 --> 00:38:00,620
Don't close your eyes!

695
00:38:02,060 --> 00:38:02,700
Don't pass out!

696
00:38:04,020 --> 00:38:05,060
Wake up! Come on!

697
00:38:06,940 --> 00:38:07,340
Wenji!

698
00:38:46,820 --> 00:38:47,260
Doctor,

699
00:38:47,860 --> 00:38:48,580
how is he?

700
00:38:50,580 --> 00:38:51,700
He'll survive.

701
00:38:52,780 --> 00:38:53,100
But

702
00:38:53,860 --> 00:38:54,940
he's permanently maimed.

703
00:38:56,300 --> 00:38:57,180
What do you mean?

704
00:38:58,260 --> 00:38:58,820
I mean...

705
00:39:00,020 --> 00:39:01,500
He can no longer function as a man.

706
00:39:04,820 --> 00:39:05,780
Doctor! Doctor!

707
00:39:06,260 --> 00:39:06,900
But my friend...

708
00:39:07,340 --> 00:39:08,340
Doctor! Doctor!

709
00:39:08,820 --> 00:39:09,940
No matter how rare the medicine,

710
00:39:10,180 --> 00:39:11,620
I'll find a way to get it for you!

711
00:39:12,460 --> 00:39:13,140
Young man,

712
00:39:13,380 --> 00:39:14,980
a shattered mirror can't be made whole.

713
00:39:15,420 --> 00:39:17,060
How can a severed part be reattached?

714
00:39:17,060 --> 00:39:17,420
Doctor!

715
00:39:17,700 --> 00:39:18,300
Please think again!

716
00:39:18,540 --> 00:39:19,500
Isn't there another way?

717
00:39:20,220 --> 00:39:20,980
- I'll do whatever I can!
- I...

718
00:39:21,820 --> 00:39:23,300
There's really nothing I can do!

719
00:39:23,300 --> 00:39:24,700
Doctor, please examine him again!

720
00:39:25,140 --> 00:39:26,020
You haven't even prescribed anything!

721
00:39:26,220 --> 00:39:27,100
How can you be sure
without even trying?

722
00:39:28,060 --> 00:39:28,620
Young man,

723
00:39:29,020 --> 00:39:30,540
please don't make this harder for me.

724
00:39:31,140 --> 00:39:32,780
It's not that I refuse
to prescribe medicine.

725
00:39:33,180 --> 00:39:33,500
It's...

726
00:39:33,860 --> 00:39:35,980
His injury is beyond the reach
of medicine.

727
00:39:36,660 --> 00:39:37,860
The severed part is destroyed.

728
00:39:38,100 --> 00:39:39,220
It cannot be reattached.

729
00:39:39,220 --> 00:39:39,500
But he's...

730
00:39:40,620 --> 00:39:41,620
He's still so young!

731
00:39:42,020 --> 00:39:42,740
He's not even married!

732
00:39:42,940 --> 00:39:44,220
How will he live the rest of his life?

733
00:39:44,580 --> 00:39:44,820
Well...

734
00:39:44,980 --> 00:39:45,500
Doctor,

735
00:39:46,180 --> 00:39:47,700
I'm begging you,
please take another look!

736
00:39:48,100 --> 00:39:48,700
Young man,

737
00:39:48,940 --> 00:39:50,020
if you truly care about him,

738
00:39:50,220 --> 00:39:51,420
help him come to terms with it.

739
00:39:51,500 --> 00:39:51,780
Doctor!

740
00:39:51,780 --> 00:39:52,940
- At least he lives, with a future.
- Please!

741
00:39:52,940 --> 00:39:53,980
There must be another way!

742
00:39:54,020 --> 00:39:54,500
Please think!

743
00:39:54,500 --> 00:39:55,980
Please stop pressing me!

744
00:39:57,820 --> 00:39:58,300
Wenji!

745
00:39:58,980 --> 00:39:59,420
Wenji!

746
00:39:59,900 --> 00:40:00,340
Wenji!

747
00:40:01,500 --> 00:40:01,900
Give it to me!

748
00:40:03,500 --> 00:40:04,060
Let go!

749
00:40:04,460 --> 00:40:05,700
Wenji, give it to me!

750
00:40:07,460 --> 00:40:07,980
Let go!

751
00:40:11,820 --> 00:40:12,300
Yan Shang.

752
00:40:13,620 --> 00:40:14,380
Let me die.

753
00:40:14,780 --> 00:40:15,220
Let go.

754
00:40:25,140 --> 00:40:25,620
Yan Shang.

755
00:40:26,940 --> 00:40:28,220
Why won't you let me die?

756
00:40:28,700 --> 00:40:30,260
Why won't you just let me die?

757
00:40:30,780 --> 00:40:32,140
Why did you save me?

758
00:40:32,260 --> 00:40:34,020
Why did you save me?

759
00:40:34,220 --> 00:40:34,620
You're right!

760
00:40:35,300 --> 00:40:36,260
I shouldn't have saved you!

761
00:40:37,860 --> 00:40:38,900
You've turned the Liu Wenji,
the man you used to be,

762
00:40:39,300 --> 00:40:40,580
into a pathetic wreck!

763
00:40:41,020 --> 00:40:42,220
I might as well kill you myself!

764
00:40:45,100 --> 00:40:47,180
The man I used to be...

765
00:40:50,620 --> 00:40:52,980
The man I used to be...

766
00:40:54,580 --> 00:40:56,860
The man I used to be...

767
00:41:07,900 --> 00:41:09,740
The man I used to be...

768
00:41:15,060 --> 00:41:16,620
The man I used to be...

769
00:41:23,500 --> 00:41:25,060
The man I used to be...

770
00:41:38,060 --> 00:41:39,100
The Liu Wenji I knew,

771
00:41:40,700 --> 00:41:41,900
the fourteenth son
of the Liu family from Lingnan,

772
00:41:43,020 --> 00:41:43,820
was clever

773
00:41:44,940 --> 00:41:45,660
and easygoing.

774
00:41:47,460 --> 00:41:49,060
Even when life dealt him a setback,

775
00:41:50,140 --> 00:41:51,100
he might lose his temper

776
00:41:52,180 --> 00:41:53,420
and make me want to punch him.

777
00:41:56,180 --> 00:41:57,060
But in the end,

778
00:41:57,820 --> 00:41:59,140
he'd always come to me and say,

779
00:42:01,580 --> 00:42:02,180
"I'm sorry."

780
00:42:06,420 --> 00:42:09,100
That Liu Wenji is already dead.

781
00:42:16,300 --> 00:42:17,100
How can he be dead?

782
00:42:18,380 --> 00:42:19,420
When I was imprisoned
at the Investigation Office,

783
00:42:20,380 --> 00:42:22,100
he did everything he could to save me.

784
00:42:24,140 --> 00:42:25,500
I haven't even repaid his kindness.

785
00:42:27,020 --> 00:42:28,060
How dare he die now

786
00:42:29,340 --> 00:42:30,260
and leave me forever in his debt?

787
00:42:39,780 --> 00:42:41,820
But I'm a broken man now.

788
00:42:44,900 --> 00:42:46,900
Why would you still want me as a friend?

789
00:42:50,260 --> 00:42:51,220
I'll treat you

790
00:42:52,700 --> 00:42:53,780
the way you've always treated me.

791
00:42:54,660 --> 00:42:56,020
No matter what happens,

792
00:42:58,540 --> 00:42:59,700
you'll always be my friend.

793
00:43:02,260 --> 00:43:02,980
Wenji.

794
00:43:11,900 --> 00:43:12,340
Shang.

795
00:43:16,100 --> 00:43:17,340
If you're truly my friend,

796
00:43:20,980 --> 00:43:22,300
then let me end my suffering.

797
00:43:31,820 --> 00:43:32,700
There's nothing left

798
00:43:34,700 --> 00:43:36,460
worth living for.

799
00:43:48,580 --> 00:43:49,140
If I told you

800
00:43:50,980 --> 00:43:52,140
I understand how you feel,

801
00:43:53,220 --> 00:43:54,020
you might not believe me.

802
00:43:57,900 --> 00:43:58,860
But in this world,

803
00:44:00,380 --> 00:44:02,220
many people suffer so much

804
00:44:03,900 --> 00:44:05,540
that death seems preferable,
yet they keep living,

805
00:44:07,380 --> 00:44:08,740
just to see how things turn out.

806
00:44:12,140 --> 00:44:13,540
What future could I possibly have?

807
00:44:23,540 --> 00:44:24,500
Are you really willing

808
00:44:26,500 --> 00:44:27,340
to let it end like this?

809
00:44:28,580 --> 00:44:30,380
What choice do I have?

810
00:44:34,140 --> 00:44:35,540
Look at me now!

811
00:44:36,980 --> 00:44:39,700
I'm neither man nor woman!

812
00:44:40,060 --> 00:44:41,740
I'm ruined!

813
00:44:43,780 --> 00:44:46,180
I can never take the imperial exams
again.

814
00:44:47,260 --> 00:44:50,380
I'll never be able to love anyone again!

815
00:44:54,740 --> 00:44:55,340
Yan Shang,

816
00:44:57,060 --> 00:44:59,300
there's no path left for me.

817
00:45:09,540 --> 00:45:09,980
Wenji,

818
00:45:12,740 --> 00:45:14,460
if you can't live for hope,

819
00:45:16,260 --> 00:45:16,700
then

820
00:45:19,580 --> 00:45:21,180
live for what you refuse to let go of.

821
00:45:30,300 --> 00:45:31,860
The man who did this to you...

822
00:45:33,140 --> 00:45:34,300
Do you know who he is?

823
00:45:37,060 --> 00:45:37,620
Are you

824
00:45:38,860 --> 00:45:41,660
really going to let him
get away with this?

825
00:45:47,980 --> 00:45:52,700
(Next Episode Preview)

826
00:45:52,820 --> 00:45:53,380
This family

827
00:45:53,820 --> 00:45:54,500
can't be brought down

828
00:45:54,500 --> 00:45:56,220
by some low-ranking official

829
00:45:56,340 --> 00:45:57,140
like you.

830
00:45:57,540 --> 00:45:58,620
Do I need to do it myself?

831
00:45:59,220 --> 00:46:02,140
Fierce tigers will devour
jackals like Zhang Jun.

832
00:46:02,380 --> 00:46:03,940
The tiger powerful enough
to destroy the Zhang family...

833
00:46:04,780 --> 00:46:05,700
In all of Sheng'an,

834
00:46:06,340 --> 00:46:07,260
only one family fits the bill.

835
00:46:11,840 --> 00:46:15,133
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

836
00:46:17,818 --> 00:46:22,734
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

837
00:46:24,928 --> 00:46:30,773
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

838
00:46:31,273 --> 00:46:36,499
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

839
00:46:39,268 --> 00:46:44,059
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

840
00:46:44,895 --> 00:46:50,974
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

841
00:46:52,775 --> 00:46:55,925
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

842
00:46:55,925 --> 00:46:57,573
♪Burning bright as a song♪

843
00:46:57,625 --> 00:47:01,349
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

844
00:47:01,727 --> 00:47:06,393
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

845
00:47:07,012 --> 00:47:11,053
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

846
00:47:11,544 --> 00:47:13,659
♪Not a single hour less♪

847
00:47:13,699 --> 00:47:20,645
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

848
00:47:21,408 --> 00:47:24,861
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

849
00:47:25,041 --> 00:47:28,186
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

850
00:47:28,625 --> 00:47:35,262
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

851
00:47:35,659 --> 00:47:37,697
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

852
00:47:37,697 --> 00:47:40,173
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

853
00:47:40,211 --> 00:47:42,680
♪You're the only one I need♪

854
00:47:42,884 --> 00:47:49,771
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

855
00:47:50,083 --> 00:47:53,354
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

856
00:47:53,659 --> 00:47:56,832
♪My last untouched innocence♪

857
00:47:57,156 --> 00:48:00,582
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

858
00:48:00,815 --> 00:48:04,040
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

859
00:48:04,371 --> 00:48:11,167
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

860
00:48:11,536 --> 00:48:13,598
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

861
00:48:13,599 --> 00:48:16,102
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

862
00:48:16,149 --> 00:48:18,487
♪You're the only one I need♪

863
00:48:18,718 --> 00:48:25,553
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

864
00:48:25,902 --> 00:48:27,520
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

865
00:48:27,650 --> 00:48:29,446
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

866
00:48:29,803 --> 00:48:32,820
♪You're the only one I need♪

867
00:48:32,860 --> 00:48:34,187
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
